  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irrigation &amp; Drainage Rehabilitation Project (Serbia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s main objectives are to: (a) improve the capacity for increased agricultural yields through support to high priority rehabilitation of drainage and irrigation infrastructure; (b) reduce the risk of damage from flooding to land, crops, property, infrastructure as well as reducing risk of life loss from flooding in project areas; and (c) improve water resources management and strengthen the associated water resource management institutions and policies.</narrative>
  </description>
